%% title: Two ways to get the lottery order
%% desc: At a lottery step the office either draws the lottery in the app, once, or uploads an Excel list made outside. Either way every applicant gets a lottery number, and the merit list follows that order.
flowchart LR
  S["Lottery step"] --> D["Draw the lottery in the app<br/>only once"]
  S --> U["Upload a list<br/>Excel, checked first"]
  D --> N["Every applicant has a lottery number"]:::done
  U --> N
  N --> M["Merit list in that order"]
  classDef done fill:#ebfbee,stroke:#2b8a3e,color:#14411d
  classDef stop fill:#fff5f5,stroke:#c92a2a,color:#5c1111
